    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/extras/b2eee536cb1768b93ec8b18779e2b759.avif?t=1755072603\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another busy day at the office, and you\u2019re one cute, cheeky dog!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruff Day At The Office is a delightfully funny game where you turn a cozy corporate world into a hilarious mess.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You\u2019ll Find:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mischievous office dog (that's you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An office full of humans just trying to work (you don't care)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of desks to disrupt and snacks to steal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Computers that were working just fine (until you showed up)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb from the lobby to the top management CEO\u2019s office through a stack of crazy levels! Every floor brings new office vibes, tougher chaos to spark, and tons of funny stuff to uncover as you climb the building.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/extras/87cdbf4b5ab5de0ccd7d19475a215804.poster.avif?t=1755072603\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/extras/87cdbf4b5ab5de0ccd7d19475a215804.webm?t=1755072603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say hello to Mochi, the office\u2019s newest hire: adorable, unstoppable, and here to make every day a ruff one. Wishlist now for a dose of playful chaos!</p>",
